 "descripcion": "Ruth finally told Kit why Alder Street feeds the black dog, and what happened to the man who lived in his house in 2009.\n\nWould you have opened the door?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
